{"description":"The Collection welcomes you to this stylish and chic 78 m² flat nestled in the sought-after Sentier district, in the heart of Paris's 2nd arrondissement. With its three comfortable bedrooms and modern amenities, this space exudes an authentic yet warm atmosphere. Take advantage of its proximity to numerous museums for an incomparable cultural experience.Ideally located, surrounded by quaint boutiques, gourmet restaurants, lively cafés and superb monuments. You can explore the cobbled streets oThe spaceWelcome to your new home! Enjoy a memorable experience in the heart of bustling Paris in this delightful haven of peace nestled in the lively Sentier district. Ideally located on the ground floor, this 78 m² flat will win you over with its harmonious blend of warm, authentic decor and a touch of modernity.Please note we are the new management team of this apartment, you may see some of the incredible reviews from previous stays at this same house! We are looking forward to welcoming you as well for even a much better experience ☀️We are managers of several units in the same building, ideal for large families, groups of friends and business trips. Send us a message for more information about our other properties! APARTMENT DISTRIBUTIONThe apartment has a capacity for up to 8 guests distributed as follows: - Bedroom 1: Double bed and ensuite full bathroom (bathtub + sink + wc chamber) - Bedroom 2: Double bed and ensuite bathroom (shower + sink) + (a separate wc chamber next to the apartment entrance)- Bedroom 3: Double bed + Double bed and ensuite full bathroom SPECIAL FEATURES: - The unit has been entirely renovated with exquisite taste! - The apartment is located at ground floor, but please note there are some steps inside the house. - A cleverly laid-out living room with ","amenities":[{"title":"Bath","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hairdryer","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hot water","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Washi